@startuml
hide footbox
title US003 - Register Genre to Official Genre List

box #Lightyellow
actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI
end box

participant ":RegisterGenreController" as RegisterGenreController
participant ":GenreRepository" as GenreRepository

Administrator -> UI : **1** I want to add a new genre to the official list
UI -->> Administrator : **2** Please enter the genre name
Administrator -> UI : **3** Romance

UI -> RegisterGenreController : **4** createAndAddGenre(name="Romance")
activate RegisterGenreController

RegisterGenreController -> GenreRepository : **5** createAndAddGenre(name)
activate GenreRepository

GenreRepository -> GenreRepository : **6** existsByName(name)?

  create "Romance:Genre" as Genre
  GenreRepository -> Genre : **7** createGenre("Romance")
  GenreRepository -> GenreRepository : **8** addToList(Romance)
  GenreRepository -->> RegisterGenreController : **9** Romance


deactivate GenreRepository

RegisterGenreController -->> UI : **10** success / error
deactivate RegisterGenreController

UI -->> Administrator : **11** result message
@enduml
